                                                "sense_id": "b9c97904-3c31-350c-a722-b8332e968f91",
                                                "text": "The government has said in a paper on the UK’s post-Brexit border operating model that it will “ensure that EU, EEA and Swiss citizens may also continue to use our e-passport gates and the existing queueing arrangements”."
